---
interface Props {
  lang: "en" | "ru";
}

const { lang = "en" } = Astro.props;

const dict = {
  en: {
    svgTitle: "Socket hardening checklist in English and Russian: five production failure modes each paired with its single defense",
    headline: "SOCKET HARDENING CHECKLIST",
    sub: "every failure is predictable — each has one defense",
    leftHead: "FAILURE MODE",
    rightHead: "DEFENSE",
    f1: "idle socket pins fd",
    d1: "setTimeout + destroy()",
    f2: "Slowloris dribble",
    d2: "headersTimeout + requestTimeout",
    f3: "ECONNRESET / EPIPE",
    d3: "per-socket 'error' handler",
    f4: "unbounded accept",
    d4: "maxConnections + ulimit -n",
    f5: "SIGTERM reset storm",
    d5: "server.close() + drain",
    caption:
      "The whole lesson as one checklist: idle sockets leak fds until setTimeout plus destroy reclaims them, Slowloris falls to header and request timeouts, ECONNRESET and EPIPE need a per-socket error handler, unbounded accept needs maxConnections and ulimit, and SIGTERM needs close plus drain.",
  },
  ru: {
    svgTitle: "Чеклист закалки сокетов: пять продакшн-отказов, каждому отвечает одна защита",
    headline: "ЧЕКЛИСТ ЗАКАЛКИ СОКЕТОВ",
    sub: "каждый сбой предсказуем — у каждого одна защита",
    leftHead: "РЕЖИМ ОТКАЗА",
    rightHead: "ЗАЩИТА",
    f1: "idle-сокет держит fd",
    d1: "setTimeout + destroy()",
    f2: "Slowloris-капание",
    d2: "headersTimeout + requestTimeout",
    f3: "ECONNRESET / EPIPE",
    d3: "обработчик 'error' на сокете",
    f4: "безграничный accept",
    d4: "maxConnections + ulimit -n",
    f5: "шторм reset на SIGTERM",
    d5: "server.close() + слив",
    caption:
      "Весь урок одним чеклистом: idle-сокеты текут fd, пока setTimeout плюс destroy их не вернёт, Slowloris бьётся таймаутами заголовков и запроса, ECONNRESET и EPIPE требуют обработчика error на каждом сокете, безграничный accept — maxConnections и ulimit, а SIGTERM — close плюс слив.",
  },
};

const t = dict[lang];
---

<figure data-lesson-visual class="my-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 800 420" role="img" font-family="var(--font-mono)">
    <title lang="en">{dict.en.svgTitle}</title>
    <title lang="ru">{dict.ru.svgTitle}</title>
    <text x="400" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" fill="var(--ink)">{t.headline}</text>
    <text x="400" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">{t.sub}</text>

    <text x="190" y="90" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.leftHead}</text>
    <text x="590" y="90" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.rightHead}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="102" width="300" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="190" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.f1}</text>
    <rect x="440" y="102" width="320" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="600" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.d1}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="162" width="300" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="190" y="188" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.f2}</text>
    <rect x="440" y="162" width="320" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="600" y="188" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.d2}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="222" width="300" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="190" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.f3}</text>
    <rect x="440" y="222" width="320" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="600" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.d3}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="282" width="300" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="190" y="308" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.f4}</text>
    <rect x="440" y="282" width="320" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="600" y="308" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.d4}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="342" width="300" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="190" y="368" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.f5}</text>
    <rect x="440" y="342" width="320" height="42" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="600" y="368" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.d5}</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption style="text-align: center;">{t.caption}</figcaption>
</figure>
